{"id": 35, "ts": 1780473240.0182161, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s focus on the unknowns around Candidate\u202fD\u2019s temperament, but I must confirm that I have no observations on how his hot temper translates into crew interaction or decision\u2011making. Without concrete evidence, the risk profile for D remains indeterminate. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s record is clear: 100\u202f% reliability, a consistently positive crew atmosphere, and the ability to make correct decisions quickly\u2014key for long\u2011haul operations. While his communication style and willingness to pursue further education are areas for development, those are addressable through training. Given the documented memory\u2011for\u2011numbers weakness and hostile remarks of Candidate\u202fB, and the lack of any data on D\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC as the strongest overall fit."}
